# Paraglide
project.inlang/cache
# Regenerated by the inlang SDK on every run (SDK version stamp, README boilerplate,
# and a .gitignore inlang manages itself). Tracking them produced a permanent dirty
# working tree that also failed `moon frontend:format`. Only settings.json and
# project_id are ours to keep.
project.inlang/.gitignore
project.inlang/.meta.json
project.inlang/README.md
src/lib/paraglide

